# Generated architecture pages are written verbatim by the submission
# importer and embed JSX component props (e.g. CNCFProjectCard
# `description={"..."}`) inline in prose. Prettier's markdown formatter
# rewraps that prose across lines, which breaks the JS string literal and
# fails the MDX build with "Could not parse expression with acorn" (see #681,
# #795). Excludes every generated org page (docs/architectures/<id>/index.md);
# the hand-authored pages (the set in scripts/lib/architecture-pages.mjs) sit
# directly in docs/architectures/ and stay formatted.
docs/architectures/*/index.md
# Blog posts contain MDX JSX comments ({/* truncate */}) that prettier's markdown
# parser mangles into {/_ _/}, breaking Docusaurus truncation and SSG:
blog/
